            "body": "> So I think that the 1. is the best course of action here. Short-term: add something like `` For highlighting the output install |treesitter| `diff` parser and `highlight.scm` |treesitter-query| ``. Long-term: bundle `diff` parser and its queries _or_ have an \"officially recommended\" way to install them (with `vim.pack.add`).\n\nyeah agreed. I'm in favor of bundling the `diff` ts parser, but I think @clason pointed out some issues with it that I don't remember",
